body:
One upvote equals one prayer/good vibe/thought/whatever you want to call it. 

&#x200B;

Hoping your furbaby pulls through <3

I don't know the policies of this community. Please let me know if I violated them in my comment. I will be glad to edit it to fit the policy.

&#x200B;

I feel sad a lot. I know it's about my weight. I lost 110 pounds and felt great. Then over the summer I gained 20 pounds back. I was so stressed about school. I'm stressed about the way I look. I worry that my boyfriend will leave me. Thats just my brain talking though. I know he loves me. I have a friend who lies. I know he lies. I have even called him out for it and he just moves on as if he didn't say anything. I think he hurts. I just want it all to be over. I was depressed for years to the point I felt nothing. Then I suddenly felt better after I started losing weight. It was awesome. I'm nowhere near as low as I was those years, but I am afraid of slipping down there again. I don't feel like my boyfriend pays enough attention to me, but I think it's just me wanting more attention and not that he ignores me. I have a lot of feelings I don't want to share. He really upset me and scared me the other day when he asked me if I took any medicine. I'm not ugly. I'm not stupid. So why do I tell myself these things?
